ronments and 2D sprites. The game features 4 immersive levels, a player lobby and 2 game modes: \"Mission\" and \"Last stand\".", "short_description": "Theta Legion is an immersive first person shooter for the Oculus Go. Inspired by classics such as Doom and Quake, Theta Legion visual features include pixel-art textures and a mix of 3D environments and 2D sprites. The game features 4 immersive levels, a player lobby and 2 game modes: \"Mission\" and \"Last stand\"."}]}, "developer_name": "Avant Games, Garage Collective", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/145b5c9e-5bd8-4f9f-95e0-88452d6e9695", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Avant Games, Garage Collective", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.facebook.com/ThetaLegion/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4867527106673210"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974541_719794518376069_5678374024363638784_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ONNppONv78Q7kNvwFObTz4&_nc_oc=AdmmLSjE3XVMs07dqaEnhOX2TB4Sj06dpTaKXlp9gQ9LUvw9cX9aiGzWCbXnav87-Bk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy6Q3xfeyDdY5BvuPW-KHQfiaJNs3DXbLQgm21zE3Ayfg&oe=69AEAE9C"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Theta Legion", "platform": "ANDRO